tem-ui, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;Fira Sans&quot;, Ubuntu, Oxygen, &quot;Oxygen Sans&quot;, Cantarell, &quot;Droid Sans&quot;, &quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;, &quot;Lucida Grande&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9); line-height: inherit !important;\"><br style=\"box-sizing: inherit; line-height: inherit !important;\"></span><span style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.9); font-family: -apple-system, system-ui, BlinkMacSystemFont, &quot;Segoe UI&quot;, Roboto, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, &quot;Fira Sans&quot;, Ubuntu, Oxygen, &quot;Oxygen Sans&quot;, Cantarell, &quot;Droid Sans&quot;, &quot;Apple Color Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Emoji&quot;, &quot;Segoe UI Symbol&quot;, &quot;Lucida Grande&quot;, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px;\">Large market. Set rules. Almost no competition. That does not last.</span></p>',NULL,'reports/DCt5oYz8q04AUixwcDoMLQw1X2N056sRevMQgSLt.png',NULL,0,NULL,'https://devmantra.com/report-files/india-critical-minerals-battery-recycling-march-2026.html','Read More','5 min read','published','2026-03-28 04:50:00',NULL,'2026-03-28 04:50:13','2026-04-03 04:57:08',NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL),(2,'RBI M&A Financing Rules 2026 Explained: Limits, Eligibility, and Market Impact','rbi-ma-financing-rules-2026-explained-limits-eligibility-and-market-impact','<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:10.0pt;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:\r\n4.0pt;margin-left:0cm\"><b><span style=\"font-size:26.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:Arial;color:#1A1A2E\">RBI Opens M&amp;A Financing:</span></b><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:6.0pt\"><b><span style=\"font-size:26.0pt;\r\nfont-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:Arial;color:#1F4E79\">What\r\nthe Numbers Actually Say</span></b><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n\r\n<div style=\"mso-element:para-border-div;border:none;border-left:solid #1F4E79 1.5pt;\r\npadding:0cm 0cm 0cm 10.0pt;margin-left:10.0pt;margin-right:0cm\">\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:4.0pt;text-align:justify;border:none;\r\nmso-border-left-alt:solid #1F4E79 1.5pt;padding:0cm;mso-padding-alt:0cm 0cm 0cm 10.0pt\"><i><span style=\"font-size:11.5pt;color:#333366\">After 70 years of prohibition, Indian\r\nbanks can now fund corporate acquisitions. Here\'s a data-first breakdown of the\r\nrules, the market size, and what it means for dealmakers.</span></i><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:5.0pt;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:12.0pt;\r\nmargin-left:0cm\"><span style=\"font-size:9.0pt;color:#888888\">Effective Date:\r\nApril 1, 2026&nbsp; ·&nbsp; Framework: RBI Capital Market Exposure\r\nDirections, 2026</span><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n\r\n<table class=\"MsoNormalTable\" border=\"1\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" width=\"600\" style=\"width: 450pt; border-width: medium; border-style: none; border-color: currentcolor; border-image: initial;\">\r\n <tbody><tr>\r\n  <td width=\"150\" style=\"width: 112.5pt; border-width: 1pt; border-color: rgb(208, 223, 240); background: rgb(214, 232, 245); padding: 8pt;\">\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" align=\"center\" style=\"margin-bottom:2.0pt;text-align:center\"><b><span style=\"font-size:18.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n  Arial;color:#1F4E79\">₹5L Cr</span></b><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" align=\"center\" style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:9.0pt;color:#333333\">Estimated lending opportunity unlocked</span><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n  <td width=\"150\" style=\"width: 112.5pt; border-width: 1pt 1pt 1pt medium; border-style: solid solid solid none; border-color: rgb(208, 223, 240) rgb(208, 223, 240) rgb(208, 223, 240) currentcolor; background: rgb(214, 232, 245); padding: 8pt;\">\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" align=\"center\" style=\"margin-bottom:2.0pt;text-align:center\"><b><span style=\"font-size:18.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n  Arial;color:#1F4E79\">70 yrs</span></b><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" align=\"center\" style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:9.0pt;color:#333333\">Duration of the prior prohibition</span><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n  <td width=\"150\" style=\"width: 112.5pt; border-width: 1pt 1pt 1pt medium; border-style: solid solid solid none; border-color: rgb(208, 223, 240) rgb(208, 223, 240) rgb(208, 223, 240) currentcolor; background: rgb(214, 232, 245); padding: 8pt;\">\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" align=\"center\" style=\"margin-bottom:2.0pt;text-align:center\"><b><span style=\"font-size:18.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n  Arial;color:#1F4E79\">75%</span></b><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" align=\"center\" style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:9.0pt;color:#333333\">Max bank financing of deal value</span><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n  <td width=\"150\" style=\"width: 112.5pt; border-width: 1pt 1pt 1pt medium; border-style: solid solid solid none; border-color: rgb(208, 223, 240) rgb(208, 223, 240) rgb(208, 223, 240) currentcolor; background: rgb(214, 232, 245); padding: 8pt;\">\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" align=\"center\" style=\"margin-bottom:2.0pt;text-align:center\"><b><span style=\"font-size:18.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n  Arial;color:#1F4E79\">20%</span></b><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" align=\"center\" style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:9.0pt;color:#333333\">Cap on Tier-1 capital per bank</span><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n </tr>\r\n</tbody></table>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:15.0pt\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>\r\n\r\n<div style=\"mso-element:para-border-div;border:none;border-bottom:solid #1F4E79 1.0pt;\r\nmso-border-bottom-alt:solid #1F4E79 .5pt;padding:0cm 0cm 4.0pt 0cm\">\r\n\r\n<h2 style=\"border:none;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid #1F4E79 .5pt;padding:0cm;\r\nmso-padding-alt:0cm 0cm 4.0pt 0cm\">The Rule Change, Precisely<o:p></o:p></h2>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:4.0pt;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:6.0pt;\r\nmargin-left:0cm;text-align:justify\"><span style=\"color:#222222\">On February 13,\r\n2026, the RBI issued final Amendment Directions under its Capital Market\r\nExposure framework, effective April 1, 2026. The rules doubled the acquisition\r\nfinance cap from the initially proposed 10% to 20% of a bank\'s Tier-1 capital —\r\nafter banks collectively pushed back during the consultation period.</span><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:6.0pt\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>\r\n\r\n<table class=\"MsoNormalTable\" border=\"1\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" width=\"600\" style=\"width: 450pt; border-width: medium; border-style: none; border-color: currentcolor; border-image: initial;\">\r\n <thead>\r\n  <tr>\r\n   <td width=\"240\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width: 180pt; border-width: 1pt; border-style: none none solid; border-color: white white rgb(170, 170, 170); background: rgb(31, 78, 121); padding: 5pt 7pt;\">\r\n   <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"font-size:9.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n   mso-fareast-font-family:Arial;color:white;text-transform:uppercase\">PARAMETER</span></b><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n   </td>\r\n   <td width=\"360\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:270.0pt;border-top:none white 1.0pt;\r\n   border-left:none;border-bottom:solid #AAAAAA 1.0pt;border-right:none white 1.0pt;\r\n   mso-border-left-alt:none white 0cm;mso-border-alt:none white 0cm;mso-border-bottom-alt:\r\n   solid #AAAAAA .25pt;background:#1F4E79;padding:5.0pt 7.0pt 5.0pt 7.0pt\">\r\n   <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"font-size:9.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;\r\n   mso-fareast-font-family:Arial;color:white;text-transform:uppercase\">FINAL\r\n   RULE (FEB 2026)</span></b><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n   </td>\r\n  </tr>\r\n </thead>\r\n <tbody><tr>\r\n  <td width=\"240\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:180.0pt;border-top:none;border-left:\r\n  none white 1.0pt;border-bottom:solid #CCCCCC 1.0pt;border-right:none white 1.0pt;\r\n  mso-border-top-alt:none white 0cm;mso-border-alt:none white 0cm;mso-border-bottom-alt:\r\n  solid #CCCCCC .25pt;background:#F4F6F8;padding:4.5pt 7.0pt 4.5pt 7.0pt\">\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;color:#555555\">Max bank\r\n  financing per deal</span><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n  <td width=\"360\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:270.0pt;border-top:none;border-left:\r\n  none;border-bottom:solid #CCCCCC 1.0pt;border-right:none white 1.0pt;\r\n  mso-border-top-alt:none white 0cm;mso-border-left-alt:none white 0cm;\r\n  mso-border-alt:none white 0cm;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid #CCCCCC .25pt;\r\n  background:#F4F6F8;padding:4.5pt 7.0pt 4.5pt 7.0pt\">\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;color:#1A1A2E\">75% of\r\n  acquisition value</span></b><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n </tr>\r\n <tr>\r\n  <td width=\"240\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width: 180pt; border-width: medium 1pt 1pt; border-style: none none solid; border-color: currentcolor white rgb(204, 204, 204); background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; padding: 4.5pt 7pt;\">\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;color:#555555\">Min promoter\r\n  contribution</span><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n  <td width=\"360\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width: 270pt; border-width: medium 1pt 1pt medium; border-style: none none solid; border-color: currentcolor white rgb(204, 204, 204) currentcolor; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; padding: 4.5pt 7pt;\">\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;color:#1A1A2E\">25%\r\n  equity, own funds</span></b><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n </tr>\r\n <tr>\r\n  <td width=\"240\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:180.0pt;border-top:none;border-left:\r\n  none white 1.0pt;border-bottom:solid #CCCCCC 1.0pt;border-right:none white 1.0pt;\r\n  mso-border-top-alt:none white 0cm;mso-border-alt:none white 0cm;mso-border-bottom-alt:\r\n  solid #CCCCCC .25pt;background:#F4F6F8;padding:4.5pt 7.0pt 4.5pt 7.0pt\">\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;color:#555555\">Acquisition\r\n  finance cap per bank</span><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n  <td width=\"360\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:270.0pt;border-top:none;border-left:\r\n  none;border-bottom:solid #CCCCCC 1.0pt;border-right:none white 1.0pt;\r\n  mso-border-top-alt:none white 0cm;mso-border-left-alt:none white 0cm;\r\n  mso-border-alt:none white 0cm;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid #CCCCCC .25pt;\r\n  background:#F4F6F8;padding:4.5pt 7.0pt 4.5pt 7.0pt\">\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;color:#1A1A2E\">20% of\r\n  Tier-1 capital</span></b><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n </tr>\r\n <tr>\r\n  <td width=\"240\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width: 180pt; border-width: medium 1pt 1pt; border-style: none none solid; border-color: currentcolor white rgb(204, 204, 204); background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; padding: 4.5pt 7pt;\">\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;color:#555555\">Total direct\r\n  capital market exposure</span><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n  <td width=\"360\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width: 270pt; border-width: medium 1pt 1pt medium; border-style: none none solid; border-color: currentcolor white rgb(204, 204, 204) currentcolor; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; padding: 4.5pt 7pt;\">\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;color:#1A1A2E\">40% of\r\n  Tier-1 capital</span></b><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n </tr>\r\n <tr>\r\n  <td width=\"240\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:180.0pt;border-top:none;border-left:\r\n  none white 1.0pt;border-bottom:solid #CCCCCC 1.0pt;border-right:none white 1.0pt;\r\n  mso-border-top-alt:none white 0cm;mso-border-alt:none white 0cm;mso-border-bottom-alt:\r\n  solid #CCCCCC .25pt;background:#F4F6F8;padding:4.5pt 7.0pt 4.5pt 7.0pt\">\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;color:#555555\">Borrower\r\n  eligibility</span><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n  <td width=\"360\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:270.0pt;border-top:none;border-left:\r\n  none;border-bottom:solid #CCCCCC 1.0pt;border-right:none white 1.0pt;\r\n  mso-border-top-alt:none white 0cm;mso-border-left-alt:none white 0cm;\r\n  mso-border-alt:none white 0cm;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid #CCCCCC .25pt;\r\n  background:#F4F6F8;padding:4.5pt 7.0pt 4.5pt 7.0pt\">\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;color:#1A1A2E\">Min ₹500\r\n  Cr net worth, 3 yrs profitable, listed</span></b><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n </tr>\r\n <tr>\r\n  <td width=\"240\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width: 180pt; border-width: medium 1pt 1pt; border-style: none none solid; border-color: currentcolor white rgb(204, 204, 204); background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; padding: 4.5pt 7pt;\">\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;color:#555555\">Max\r\n  debt-equity of acquirer</span><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n  <td width=\"360\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width: 270pt; border-width: medium 1pt 1pt medium; border-style: none none solid; border-color: currentcolor white rgb(204, 204, 204) currentcolor; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; padding: 4.5pt 7pt;\">\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;color:#1A1A2E\">3:1</span></b><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n </tr>\r\n <tr>\r\n  <td width=\"240\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:180.0pt;border-top:none;border-left:\r\n  none white 1.0pt;border-bottom:solid #CCCCCC 1.0pt;border-right:none white 1.0pt;\r\n  mso-border-top-alt:none white 0cm;mso-border-alt:none white 0cm;mso-border-bottom-alt:\r\n  solid #CCCCCC .25pt;background:#F4F6F8;padding:4.5pt 7.0pt 4.5pt 7.0pt\">\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;color:#555555\">Valuation\r\n  requirement</span><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n  <td width=\"360\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:270.0pt;border-top:none;border-left:\r\n  none;border-bottom:solid #CCCCCC 1.0pt;border-right:none white 1.0pt;\r\n  mso-border-top-alt:none white 0cm;mso-border-left-alt:none white 0cm;\r\n  mso-border-alt:none white 0cm;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid #CCCCCC .25pt;\r\n  background:#F4F6F8;padding:4.5pt 7.0pt 4.5pt 7.0pt\">\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;color:#1A1A2E\">2\r\n  independent valuations mandatory</span></b><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n </tr>\r\n <tr>\r\n  <td width=\"240\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width: 180pt; border-width: medium 1pt 1pt; border-style: none none solid; border-color: currentcolor white rgb(204, 204, 204); background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; padding: 4.5pt 7pt;\">\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;color:#555555\">Scope</span><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n  <td width=\"360\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width: 270pt; border-width: medium 1pt 1pt medium; border-style: none none solid; border-color: currentcolor white rgb(204, 204, 204) currentcolor; background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; padding: 4.5pt 7pt;\">\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;color:#1A1A2E\">Non-financial\r\n  entities only; PSU disinvestment allowed</span></b><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n </tr>\r\n</tbody></table>\r\n\r\n<div style=\"mso-element:para-border-div;border:none;border-bottom:solid #1F4E79 1.0pt;\r\nmso-border-bottom-alt:solid #1F4E79 .5pt;padding:0cm 0cm 4.0pt 0cm\">\r\n\r\n<h2 style=\"border:none;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid #1F4E79 .5pt;padding:0cm;\r\nmso-padding-alt:0cm 0cm 4.0pt 0cm\"><br></h2><h2 style=\"border:none;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid #1F4E79 .5pt;padding:0cm;\r\nmso-padding-alt:0cm 0cm 4.0pt 0cm\">How Big Is India\'s M&amp;A Market Right Now?<o:p></o:p></h2>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:4.0pt;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:6.0pt;\r\nmargin-left:0cm\"><span style=\"color:#222222\">The policy arrived at a moment\r\nwhen Indian dealmaking is already accelerating sharply.</span><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:6.0pt\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>\r\n\r\n<table class=\"MsoNormalTable\" border=\"1\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" width=\"600\" style=\"width: 450pt; border-width: medium; border-style: none; border-color: currentcolor; border-image: initial;\">\r\n <tbody><tr>\r\n  <td width=\"150\" style=\"width: 112.5pt; border-width: 1pt; border-color: rgb(208, 223, 240); background: rgb(214, 232, 245); padding: 8pt;\">\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" align=\"center\" style=\"margin-bottom:2.0pt;text-align:center\"><b><span style=\"font-size:18.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n  Arial;color:#1F4E79\">$157.9B</span></b><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" align=\"center\" style=\"margin-bottom:1.0pt;text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:9.0pt;color:#333333\">Total deal value, India 2025</span><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" align=\"center\" style=\"text-align:center\"><i><span style=\"font-size:8.0pt;color:#888888\">Source: LSEG</span></i><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n  <td width=\"150\" style=\"width: 112.5pt; border-width: 1pt 1pt 1pt medium; border-style: solid solid solid none; border-color: rgb(208, 223, 240) rgb(208, 223, 240) rgb(208, 223, 240) currentcolor; background: rgb(214, 232, 245); padding: 8pt;\">\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" align=\"center\" style=\"margin-bottom:2.0pt;text-align:center\"><b><span style=\"font-size:18.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n  Arial;color:#1F4E79\">$26B</span></b><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" align=\"center\" style=\"margin-bottom:1.0pt;text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:9.0pt;color:#333333\">M&amp;A value, Jan–Sep 2025</span><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" align=\"center\" style=\"text-align:center\"><i><span style=\"font-size:8.0pt;color:#888888\">649 transactions · EY India</span></i><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n  <td width=\"150\" style=\"width: 112.5pt; border-width: 1pt 1pt 1pt medium; border-style: solid solid solid none; border-color: rgb(208, 223, 240) rgb(208, 223, 240) rgb(208, 223, 240) currentcolor; background: rgb(214, 232, 245); padding: 8pt;\">\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" align=\"center\" style=\"margin-bottom:2.0pt;text-align:center\"><b><span style=\"font-size:18.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n  Arial;color:#1F4E79\">+37%</span></b><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" align=\"center\" style=\"margin-bottom:1.0pt;text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:9.0pt;color:#333333\">YoY growth in M&amp;A value, 2025</span><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" align=\"center\" style=\"text-align:center\"><i><span style=\"font-size:8.0pt;color:#888888\">vs +10% globally</span></i><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n  <td width=\"150\" style=\"width: 112.5pt; border-width: 1pt 1pt 1pt medium; border-style: solid solid solid none; border-color: rgb(208, 223, 240) rgb(208, 223, 240) rgb(208, 223, 240) currentcolor; background: rgb(214, 232, 245); padding: 8pt;\">\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" align=\"center\" style=\"margin-bottom:2.0pt;text-align:center\"><b><span style=\"font-size:18.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:\r\n  Arial;color:#1F4E79\">+66%</span></b><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" align=\"center\" style=\"margin-bottom:1.0pt;text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:9.0pt;color:#333333\">India deal surge vs Asia-Pacific</span><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" align=\"center\" style=\"text-align:center\"><i><span style=\"font-size:8.0pt;color:#888888\">APAC declined 5% same period</span></i><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n </tr>\r\n</tbody></table>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:9.0pt\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:4.0pt;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:6.0pt;\r\nmargin-left:0cm\"><span style=\"color:#222222\">Sector-wise in 2025, industrials\r\nled with $35.4B (+221% YoY), followed by energy &amp; power at $28.9B (+190%),\r\nfinancials at $27B (+152%), and high technology at $19.9B (+100%).</span><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:5.0pt\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>\r\n\r\n<table class=\"MsoNormalTable\" border=\"1\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" width=\"600\" style=\"width: 450pt; border-width: medium; border-style: none; border-color: currentcolor; border-image: initial;\">\r\n <tbody><tr>\r\n  <td width=\"300\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width: 225pt; border-width: 1pt; border-color: rgb(208, 228, 240); background: rgb(244, 246, 248); padding: 6pt 8pt;\">\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:1.5pt\"><b><span style=\"font-size:\r\n  10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:Arial;\r\n  color:#1A1A2E\">Industrials</span></b><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;color:#1F4E79\">$35.4B&nbsp; +221% YoY</span></b><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n  <td width=\"300\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width: 225pt; border-width: 1pt 1pt 1pt medium; border-style: solid solid solid none; border-color: rgb(208, 228, 240) rgb(208, 228, 240) rgb(208, 228, 240) currentcolor; background: rgb(244, 246, 248); padding: 6pt 8pt;\">\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:1.5pt\"><b><span style=\"font-size:\r\n  10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:Arial;\r\n  color:#1A1A2E\">Energy &amp; Power</span></b><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;color:#1F4E79\">$28.9B&nbsp; +190% YoY</span></b><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n </tr>\r\n <tr>\r\n  <td width=\"300\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width: 225pt; border-width: medium 1pt 1pt; border-style: none solid solid; border-color: currentcolor rgb(208, 228, 240) rgb(208, 228, 240); background: rgb(244, 246, 248); padding: 6pt 8pt;\">\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:1.5pt\"><b><span style=\"font-size:\r\n  10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:Arial;\r\n  color:#1A1A2E\">Financials</span></b><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;color:#1F4E79\">$27.0B&nbsp; +152% YoY</span></b><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n  <td width=\"300\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:225.0pt;border-top:none;border-left:\r\n  none;border-bottom:solid #D0E4F0 1.0pt;border-right:solid #D0E4F0 1.0pt;\r\n  mso-border-top-alt:solid #D0E4F0 .25pt;mso-border-left-alt:solid #D0E4F0 .25pt;\r\n  mso-border-alt:solid #D0E4F0 .25pt;background:#F4F6F8;padding:6.0pt 8.0pt 6.0pt 8.0pt\">\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom:1.5pt\"><b><span style=\"font-size:\r\n  10.5pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:Arial;\r\n  color:#1A1A2E\">High Technology</span></b><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;color:#1F4E79\">$19.9B&nbsp; +100% YoY</span></b><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n </tr>\r\n</tbody></table>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:10.0pt\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>\r\n\r\n<div style=\"mso-element:para-border-div;border:none;border-bottom:solid #1F4E79 1.0pt;\r\nmso-border-bottom-alt:solid #1F4E79 .5pt;padding:0cm 0cm 4.0pt 0cm\">\r\n\r\n<h2 style=\"border:none;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid #1F4E79 .5pt;padding:0cm;\r\nmso-padding-alt:0cm 0cm 4.0pt 0cm\">What Was Broken Before<o:p></o:p></h2>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:4.0pt;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:6.0pt;\r\nmargin-left:0cm;text-align:justify\"><span style=\"color:#222222\">Indian banks\r\nwere categorically banned from financing acquisitions since the 1950s. The\r\nlogic: acquisitions involve ownership transfer, not asset creation. Banks were\r\nexpected to fund capex and working capital not help one company buy another.\r\nThis created a structural gap.</span><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:6.0pt\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>\r\n\r\n<table class=\"MsoNormalTable\" border=\"1\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" width=\"600\" style=\"width: 450pt; border-width: medium; border-style: none; border-color: currentcolor; border-image: initial;\">\r\n <tbody><tr>\r\n  <td width=\"600\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width: 450pt; border-width: 1pt 1pt 1pt 1.5pt; border-style: none none none solid; border-color: white white white rgb(31, 78, 121); background: rgb(214, 232, 245); padding: 7pt 10pt;\">\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"text-align:justify\"><i><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;\r\n  color:#333366\">Companies needing acquisition capital had to route deals\r\n  through NBFCs, foreign banks, or PE firms&nbsp;\r\n  all significantly more expensive than domestic bank credit. Management\r\n  buyouts (MBOs) and leveraged buyouts (LBOs) were structurally impossible for\r\n  most Indian corporates without expensive offshore structures.</span></i><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n </tr>\r\n</tbody></table>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:6.0pt\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:4.0pt;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:6.0pt;\r\nmargin-left:0cm;text-align:justify\"><span style=\"color:#222222\">The SBI\r\nchairman in August 2025 publicly said the Indian Banks Association would\r\nformally petition the RBI for this change — a signal of how deep the demand was\r\nwithin the system. Two months later, the RBI announced the framework.</span><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n\r\n<div style=\"mso-element:para-border-div;border:none;border-bottom:solid #1F4E79 1.0pt;\r\nmso-border-bottom-alt:solid #1F4E79 .5pt;padding:0cm 0cm 4.0pt 0cm\">\r\n\r\n<h2 style=\"border:none;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid #1F4E79 .5pt;padding:0cm;\r\nmso-padding-alt:0cm 0cm 4.0pt 0cm\">Timeline of the Reform<o:p></o:p></h2>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:8.0pt;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:1.5pt;\r\nmargin-left:18.0pt\"><b><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:Arial;color:#1F4E79\">▸&nbsp;\r\n</span></b><b><span style=\"font-size:9.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:Arial;color:#1F4E79\">OCT 1, 2025&nbsp; </span></b><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\r\ncolor:#222222\">RBI Governor Sanjay Malhotra announces enabling framework for\r\nbank M&amp;A financing in MPC statement.</span><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:8.0pt;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:1.5pt;\r\nmargin-left:18.0pt\"><b><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:Arial;color:#1F4E79\">▸&nbsp;\r\n</span></b><b><span style=\"font-size:9.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:Arial;color:#1F4E79\">OCT 24, 2025&nbsp; </span></b><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\r\ncolor:#222222\">Draft RBI (Commercial Banks – Capital Market Exposure)\r\nDirections released for public consultation; proposes 70% deal financing, 10%\r\nTier-1 cap.</span><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:8.0pt;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:1.5pt;\r\nmargin-left:18.0pt\"><b><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:Arial;color:#1F4E79\">▸&nbsp;\r\n</span></b><b><span style=\"font-size:9.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:Arial;color:#1F4E79\">NOV 21, 2025&nbsp; </span></b><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\r\ncolor:#222222\">Deadline for stakeholder comments; banks push for higher Tier-1\r\ncap.</span><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:8.0pt;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:1.5pt;\r\nmargin-left:18.0pt\"><b><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:Arial;color:#1F4E79\">▸&nbsp;\r\n</span></b><b><span style=\"font-size:9.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:Arial;color:#1F4E79\">FEB 13, 2026&nbsp; </span></b><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\r\ncolor:#222222\">Final Amendment Directions issued: cap raised to 20% Tier-1,\r\ndeal financing to 75%, ₹500 Cr net worth requirement added.</span><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:8.0pt;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:1.5pt;\r\nmargin-left:18.0pt\"><b><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:Arial;color:#1F4E79\">▸&nbsp;\r\n</span></b><b><span style=\"font-size:9.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:Arial;color:#1F4E79\">APR 1, 2026&nbsp; </span></b><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt;\r\ncolor:#222222\">Rules come into force. Banks begin building internal acquisition\r\nfinance policies.</span><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:10.0pt\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>\r\n\r\n<div style=\"mso-element:para-border-div;border:none;border-bottom:solid #CCCCCC 1.0pt;\r\nmso-border-bottom-alt:solid #CCCCCC .25pt;padding:0cm 0cm 0cm 0cm\">\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:10.0pt;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:\r\n10.0pt;margin-left:0cm;border:none;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid #CCCCCC .25pt;\r\npadding:0cm;mso-padding-alt:0cm 0cm 0cm 0cm\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<div style=\"mso-element:para-border-div;border:none;border-bottom:solid #1F4E79 1.0pt;\r\nmso-border-bottom-alt:solid #1F4E79 .5pt;padding:0cm 0cm 4.0pt 0cm\">\r\n\r\n<h2 style=\"border:none;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid #1F4E79 .5pt;padding:0cm;\r\nmso-padding-alt:0cm 0cm 4.0pt 0cm\">What It Means for PE &amp; VC Exits<o:p></o:p></h2>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:4.0pt;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:6.0pt;\r\nmargin-left:0cm;text-align:justify\"><span style=\"color:#222222\">This is\r\narguably the highest-impact downstream effect. PE and VC firms in India have\r\nconsistently faced a structural problem: finding domestic buyers with cheap\r\nfinancing. Without bank-backed acquisition loans, buyers relied on expensive\r\nprivate credit, suppressing bid values and slowing exit timelines.</span><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:4.0pt\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:4.0pt;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:6.0pt;\r\nmargin-left:0cm;text-align:justify\"><span style=\"color:#222222\">With banks now\r\nable to finance up to 75% of a deal, a buyer acquiring a ₹1,000 Cr company\r\nneeds to bring only ₹250 Cr in equity — the rest can come from a syndicated\r\nbank facility. This directly improves deal economics for both sides and expands\r\nthe buyer pool beyond large conglomerates.</span><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:6.0pt\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>\r\n\r\n<table class=\"MsoNormalTable\" border=\"1\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" width=\"600\" style=\"width: 450pt; border-width: medium; border-style: none; border-color: currentcolor; border-image: initial;\">\r\n <tbody><tr>\r\n  <td width=\"600\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width: 450pt; border-width: 1pt 1pt 1pt 1.5pt; border-style: none none none solid; border-color: white white white rgb(31, 78, 121); background: rgb(214, 232, 245); padding: 7pt 10pt;\">\r\n  <p class=\"MsoNormal\"><i><span style=\"font-size:10.5pt;color:#333366\">The 50+\r\n  circulars governing capital market exposure since 1986 have been consolidated\r\n  and repealed under the new framework — replacing decades of patchwork\r\n  regulation with a single unified set of directions.</span></i><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n  </td>\r\n </tr>\r\n</tbody></table>\r\n\r\n<div style=\"mso-element:para-border-div;border:none;border-bottom:solid #1F4E79 1.0pt;\r\nmso-border-bottom-alt:solid #1F4E79 .5pt;padding:0cm 0cm 4.0pt 0cm\">\r\n\r\n<h2 style=\"border:none;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid #1F4E79 .5pt;padding:0cm;\r\nmso-padding-alt:0cm 0cm 4.0pt 0cm\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></h2>\r\n\r\n<h2 style=\"border:none;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid #1F4E79 .5pt;padding:0cm;\r\nmso-padding-alt:0cm 0cm 4.0pt 0cm\">The Risk the RBI Is Managing<o:p></o:p></h2>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:4.0pt;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:6.0pt;\r\nmargin-left:0cm;text-align:justify\"><span style=\"color:#222222\">Experts have\r\nflagged two concerns. First, asset-liability mismatch: acquisition loans tend\r\nto be long-duration (5–7 years) while bank funding is typically shorter.\r\nSecond, concentration risk if multiple large deals sour simultaneously.</span><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:4.0pt\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:4.0pt;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:6.0pt;\r\nmargin-left:0cm;text-align:justify\"><span style=\"color:#222222\">The 20% Tier-1\r\ncap, the 25% promoter contribution floor, the 3:1 debt-equity limit, and the\r\nrequirement for two independent valuations are all explicitly designed to\r\nprevent the balance-sheet stress seen in infrastructure loan cycles. The\r\nrestriction to non-financial entities and profitability requirements further\r\nnarrow the eligible pool to the more creditworthy end of the market.</span><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n\r\n<div style=\"mso-element:para-border-div;border:none;border-bottom:solid #CCCCCC 1.0pt;\r\nmso-border-bottom-alt:solid #CCCCCC .25pt;padding:0cm 0cm 0cm 0cm\">\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:10.0pt;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:\r\n10.0pt;margin-left:0cm;border:none;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid #CCCCCC .25pt;\r\npadding:0cm;mso-padding-alt:0cm 0cm 0cm 0cm\"><o:p>&nbsp;</o:p></p>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:4.0pt\"><b><span style=\"font-size:9.0pt;\r\nfont-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;mso-fareast-font-family:Arial;color:#888888;\r\ntext-transform:uppercase\">Sources</span></b><o:p></o:p></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:3.0pt\"><span style=\"font-size:8.5pt;\r\ncolor:#AAAAAA\">RBI Amendment Directions (Feb 13, 2026)&nbsp; ·&nbsp; EY\r\nIndia Dealtracker Q3 2025&nbsp; ·&nbsp; LSEG Deals Intelligence 2025&nbsp; ·&nbsp;\r\nBusiness Standard&nbsp; ·&nbsp; Grant Thornton Bharat Dealtracker&nbsp; ·&nbsp;\r\nAngelOne Research&nbsp; ·&nbsp; Lexology / AZB &amp; Partners&nbsp; ·&nbsp;\r\nS&amp;R Associates</span><o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:10.0pt;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:\r\n4.0pt;margin-left:0cm\"><span style=\"color: rgb(18, 18, 18); font-family: &quot;Anthropic Mono&quot;, ui-monospace, monospace; font-size: 12px; font-variant-ligatures: none; white-space: pre-wrap;\"></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:10.0pt;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:\r\n4.0pt;margin-left:0cm\"><b><span style=\"font-size:26.0pt;font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;\r\nmso-fareast-font-family:Arial;color:#1A1A2E\"></span></b></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-top:3.0pt\"><span style=\"font-size:8.5pt;\r\ncolor:#AAAAAA\"></span><o:p></o:p></p>',NULL,'reports/oSZqndoQ2zgOs2f9f5XjIZzLBSidrIQuFF3NSSJx.png',NULL,0,NULL,NULL,'Read More','5 min read','published','2026-03-01 20:01:00',NULL,'2026-04-18 19:50:53','2026-04-19 05:32:20',NULL,NULL,NULL,0,NULL);
